"""
Solution for the 4-coloring grid graph problem.
The graph edges include horizontal, vertical, and diagonal connections within unit squares.
Two cells (r, c) and (r', c') are connected if:
- |r - r'| <= 1 and |c - c'| <= 1 and not both are 0
